{"id":"7f929e689547cc3b","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-measure-atoms-random.md","title":"可计算测度的原子自动通过随机性检验","display":"thm-measure-atoms-random — 可计算测度的原子自动通过随机性检验","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-measure-atoms-random","aliases":["43-thm-measure-atoms-random"],"display":"thm-measure-atoms-random — 可计算测度的原子自动通过随机性检验","depends_on":["[[43-df-compmeasure]]","[[43-df-measure-atoms]]","[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]","[[43-df-mltestnu]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.9.1–9.9.2，印刷198–201，PDF218–221；由测度检验定义的本地推论","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-measure-atoms-random"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-measure-atoms-random</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-measure-atoms-random — 可计算测度的原子自动通过随机性检验"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8abc268dbc50df5d\" href=\"?note=8abc268dbc50df5d\" title=\"43-df-compmeasure\">43-df-compmeasure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b32588f9bb461b3\" href=\"?note=6b32588f9bb461b3\" title=\"43-df-measure-atoms\">43-df-measure-atoms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ba9a251dffb583e\" href=\"?note=2ba9a251dffb583e\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom-nu\">43-df-mlrandom-nu</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35c96ed38b162487\" href=\"?note=35c96ed38b162487\" title=\"43-df-mltestnu\">43-df-mltestnu</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.9.1–9.9.2，印刷198–201，PDF218–221；由测度检验定义的本地推论"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 是可计算Borel概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\">\\(\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLTest}_\\nu\">\\(\\operatorname{MLTest}_\\nu\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLRandom}_\\nu\">\\(\\operatorname{MLRandom}_\\nu\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6b32588f9bb461b3\" href=\"?note=6b32588f9bb461b3\" title=\"43-df-measure-atoms\">43-df-measure-atoms</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35c96ed38b162487\" href=\"?note=35c96ed38b162487\" title=\"43-df-mltestnu\">43-df-mltestnu</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2ba9a251dffb583e\" href=\"?note=2ba9a251dffb583e\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom-nu\">43-df-mlrandom-nu</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{MLRandom}_\\nu(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\in\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{MLRandom}_\\nu(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：若a=ν({X})&gt;0，选n使2<sup>{-n}&lt;a。任一ν-Martin-Löf检验U的第n层测度至多2</sup>{-n}，因此该层不能含X；X便不在检验交集中。结论依赖于带原子的测度，不能照搬公平硬币测度下随机点非可计算的结论。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.9.1–9.9.2，印刷198–201，PDF218–221；由测度检验定义的本地推论。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地推广或推论已单独注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-compmeasure","status":"resolved","id":"8abc268dbc50df5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-compmeasure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure-atoms","status":"resolved","id":"6b32588f9bb461b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure-atoms]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom-nu","status":"resolved","id":"2ba9a251dffb583e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltestnu","status":"resolved","id":"35c96ed38b162487","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mltestnu]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure-atoms","status":"resolved","id":"6b32588f9bb461b3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是可计算Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)$、$\\operatorname{MLTest}_\\nu$、$\\operatorname{MLRandom}_\\nu$ 见 [[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-mltestnu]]、[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltestnu","status":"resolved","id":"35c96ed38b162487","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是可计算Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)$、$\\operatorname{MLTest}_\\nu$、$\\operatorname{MLRandom}_\\nu$ 见 [[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-mltestnu]]、[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom-nu","status":"resolved","id":"2ba9a251dffb583e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是可计算Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)$、$\\operatorname{MLTest}_\\nu$、$\\operatorname{MLRandom}_\\nu$ 见 [[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-mltestnu]]、[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MLTest}_\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MLRandom}_\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{MLRandom}_\\nu(X).","display":true}],"bytes":1558,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-253","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-measure-atoms-random]] — 可计算测度的原子自动通过随机性检验"},{"id":"38b337ed607def8b","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本地证明：原子方向用 [[43-thm-measure-atoms-random]]。若ν({X})=0，则ν([X↾m])趋零。给定n，可有效搜索m及足够精细的柱测度近似，使上界严格小于2^{-n}；搜索总会终止，因为X可计算且存在真正小于2^{-n}的柱。所得U_n=[X↾m(n)]统一有效开，ν(U_n)≤2^{-n}，但X属于每层，故不随机。边界检查：Dirac测度使其可计算支撑点随机；无原子可计算测度下没有可计算随机点。"}],"outgoing":["8abc268dbc50df5d","6b32588f9bb461b3","2ba9a251dffb583e","35c96ed38b162487"]}